        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "The small collar has been added later.\n\nThis kind of coat would have been worn by the wife of a civil servant over a jacket and a skirt for important occasions (both official and private like birthdays or New Year parties). According to the dark colour of the ground, this coat would have been worn by an elderly woman."@en ;
